%% Figure 20.7 — The stale-set race in cache-aside
sequenceDiagram
  participant R1 as Reader
  participant C as Cache
  participant D as Database
  participant W as Writer
  R1->>C: GET k
  C-->>R1: miss
  R1->>D: SELECT k
  D-->>R1: v1
  W->>D: UPDATE k to v2
  D-->>W: committed
  W->>C: DEL k
  R1->>C: SET k v1
  Note over C: cache holds v1 until TTL, database holds v2
